WEBVTT

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:30.619
And the next thing my brain says to me is,

00:10:30.643 --> 00:10:33.009
Wow! This is so cool!

00:10:33.033 --> 00:10:34.977
(Laughter)

00:10:35.001 --> 00:10:36.564
This is so cool!

00:10:36.588 --> 00:10:39.143
How many brain scientists
have the opportunity

00:10:39.167 --> 00:10:41.976
to study their own brain
from the inside out?"

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:43.976
(Laughter)

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:47.976
And then it crosses my mind,
"But I'm a very busy woman!"

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.150
(Laughter)

00:10:49.174 --> 00:10:51.341
"I don't have time for a stroke!"

00:10:51.365 --> 00:10:54.067
So I'm like, "OK, I can't stop
the stroke from happening,

00:10:54.091 --> 00:10:57.976
so I'll do this for a week or two,
and then I'll get back to my routine. OK.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:00.452
So I've got to call help.
I've got to call work."